    <string name="about_title">About This App</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_desc">Connect a Livox Mid-360 over wired Ethernet to build 3D maps and localize on the spot.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_text">This app does not collect or send any personal or usage data. The network is used only to talk to a LiDAR connected over wired Ethernet. Maps are stored only on this %1$s in Download/MobileNDT, and raw recordings in the app\'s own folder.</string>
    <string name="about_impl">Implementation</string>
    <string name="about_impl_text">The LiDAR-inertial odometry is an independent implementation following the FAST-LIO formulation (W. Xu, F. Zhang, RA-L 2021). Communication with the Mid-360 is an independent implementation of its published protocol and does not use the Livox SDK.</string>
